    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is your premiere Jelli shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but it's not open just yet. You'll need to decide what types of Jellies to offer in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this relaxing crafting game, you\u2019ll mix and match ingredients to discover all kinds of jolly little jellies. Combine up to four ingredients at a time and start cooking. Some recipes are simple. Others are more challenging. Every jelly you uncover brings you one step closer to a fully stocked shop menu featuring a total of 100 adorable Jellies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is inspired by games like <strong>Little Alchemy</strong>, <strong>Breath of the Wild's cooking mechanic</strong>, and <strong>Slime Rancher</strong>, this game focuses on <strong>experimentation and discovery</strong>. There\u2019s no pressure or timers \u2014 just you, your ingredients, and a cozy space to create.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is your premiere Jelli shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...but it's not open just yet. You'll need to decide what types of Jellies to offer in your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this relaxing crafting game, you\u2019ll mix and match ingredients to discover all kinds of jolly little jellies. Combine up to four ingredients at a time and start cooking. Some recipes are simple. Others are more challenging. Every jelly you uncover brings you one step closer to a fully stocked shop menu featuring a total of 100 adorable Jellies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jelli Nook</strong> is inspired by games like <strong>Little Alchemy</strong>, <strong>Breath of the Wild's cooking mechanic</strong>, and <strong>Slime Rancher</strong>, this game focuses on <strong>experimentation and discovery</strong>. There\u2019s no pressure or timers \u2014 just you, your ingredients, and a cozy space to create.</p>",
    "short_description": "A cozy Jelli crafting game! Mix ingredients and discover recipes for adorable jellies. Experiment with up to four items at a time, unlock 100 recipes, and build your Jelli recipe collection at your own pace \u2014 no timers, just relaxing and playful creativity.",
